 ds_map_add(m,"Quest complete.","クエスト完了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Use Vodka","ワイフ図鑑");
 ds_map_add(m,"Use Ron","ラム酒を使う");
 ds_map_add(m,"Use Beer","ビールを使う");
 ds_map_add(m,"Use Milch","ミルクを使う");
 ds_map_add(m,"there no items here yet","ここにはまだアイテムがない");
 ds_map_add(m,"Fish","魚");
 ds_map_add(m,"it is raw we can not eat it like this Lili, maybe it is better to give it to someone else.","まだ生だよ、リリ。このままじゃ食べられない。誰かにあげたほうがいいかも。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Circus flyers","サーカスのチラシ");
 ds_map_add(m,"I have a lot of pamphlets to deliver, hopefully delivering a few will be enough.","配るチラシが山ほどある。何枚か配れば足りるといいけど。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Vodka","ウォッカ");
 ds_map_add(m,"This is my favorite is not that strong <3","これが一番好き。そんなに強くないし<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Rum","ラム酒");
 ds_map_add(m,"My Mother Always say rum is like men, the older the better. Mmmm maybe that is why she is with my father, elves live for a long time.","母さんはいつも、ラム酒は男と同じで、年季が入っているほどいいって言う。うーん、だから父さんと一緒にいるのかな。エルフは長生きだし。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Beer","ビール");
 ds_map_add(m,"Iugg, i do not like beer, the worst thing is that when you go to the bathroom, the pee smells very strong.","うえっ、ビールは好きじゃない。最悪なのは、トイレに行くとおしっこの臭いがすごくきついこと。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Magic Broom","魔法のほうき");
 ds_map_add(m,"I love this broom <3, my little feet won't hurt anymore.","このほうき大好き<3。もう小さな足が痛くならないね。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Tricotex money","トリコテックスのお金");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sam gave me this money, it is 10 dollars to use in Tricotex. I will keep it, who knows if i ever pass by.","サムがくれたお金。トリコテックスで使える10ドルだ。取っておこう。いつか立ち寄ることがあるかもしれないし。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Autographed photo of Sam","サムのサイン入り写真");
 ds_map_add(m,"I still can not believe Sam gave me a picture with his autograph <3.","サムがサイン入りの写真をくれたなんて、まだ信じられない<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"BDSM Master/Slave Contract","BDSM主従契約書");
 ds_map_add(m,"My contract with Lili, because of my problems I begged her to be my master and help me to practice my succubus powers and force me to try new things <3.","Liliと交わした契約書。自分の問題をどうにかしたくて、彼女に主人になってもらい、サキュバスの力の鍛え方を教えてもらうよう頼んだ。それに、新しいことにも無理やり挑戦させてほしいって<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Raspberry pie","ラズベリーパイ");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am supposed to recognize the scent of this foot and then guide me through the forest to Marael's house.","この足の匂いを覚えて、それを頼りに森を抜けてマラエルの家まで案内してもらうことになっている。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haigure Gun!","ハイグレガン！");
 ds_map_add(m,"This gun makes move in a very vulgar way, Just the thought of people watching me, moving uncontrollably while I make a fool of myself makes me so horny.","この銃を使うと、とんでもなく下品な動きをさせられる。人前で勝手に体が動いて、恥をさらすところを見られると思うだけで、すごく興奮しちゃう。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Holy Grail","聖杯");
 ds_map_add(m,"One of the relics of the islands. I can feel energy emanating from it.","島に伝わる聖遺物のひとつ。ここからエネルギーが放たれているのを感じる。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Crystal sphere","水晶玉");
 ds_map_add(m,"I found this half buried next to some cats, it looks like something valuable, maybe it will be useful for something.","猫たちのそばで、半分地面に埋まっているのを見つけた。何か価値のあるものみたいだし、何かの役に立つかもしれない。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oniric incense","夢見の香");
 ds_map_add(m,"This is the best thing in the world! If I use it before I go to sleep I can have lucid dreams of things that happened to me <3.","これ以上のものなんてない！ 寝る前に使えば、これまで自分に起きた出来事を明晰夢で見られるんだ<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Gilfried briefcase","ギルドフリードのブリーフケース");
 ds_map_add(m,"I have to return this briefcase to Gilfried immediately.","このブリーフケースをすぐにギルドフリードに返さなきゃ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Golden Key","黄金の鍵");
 ds_map_add(m,"There is something strange about this key, I feel like it takes my energy somehow.","この鍵には何か秘密がある。どういうわけか、私のエネルギーを吸い取っている気がする。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Smoosher uniforms","スムーシャーの制服");
 ds_map_add(m,"The uniform of the Smoosher restaurant smells a little funny.","スムーシャーの制服は、ちょっと変な匂いがする。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Aphrodisiac mushroom.","媚薬キノコ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Moo Premium Milk","モーモー・プレミアムミルク");
 ds_map_add(m,"Fura Fura Fruit","フラフラフルーツ");
 ds_map_add(m,"The fura fura fruit has the effect of creating a penis if eaten by a woman.","フラフラフルーツを女性が食べると、ペニスが生えてくる。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hea Hea Fruit","ヘアヘアフルーツ");
 ds_map_add(m,"The hea hea fruit has a very powerful aphrodisiac effect that will make anyone who eats it come into heat.","ヘアヘアフルーツには非常に強い媚薬効果があり、食べた者は誰でも発情してしまう。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Smuggled fabrics","密輸された布地");
 ds_map_add(m,"I understand there was a convict who wanted to sell this, they ended up taking it from her and reselling it themselves (speaking of irony).","これを売ろうとしていた囚人がいたらしい。ところが品物を取り上げられたうえ、取り上げた側が自分たちで売り直したそうだ。皮肉な話ね。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sewing machine","ミシン");
 ds_map_add(m,"Blue crystal key","青い水晶の鍵");
 ds_map_add(m,"It is a key that was found inside a strange slime.","奇妙なスライムの体内から見つかった鍵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Purple crystal key","紫の水晶の鍵");
 ds_map_add(m,"Pink crystal key","ピンクの水晶の鍵");
 ds_map_add(m,"Cum jar","精液の瓶");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ñom yum yum it looks delicious I will let it ripen a bit before eating <3.","ん〜、もぐもぐ。おいしそう！ 食べる前に、もう少し熟すのを待とうっと<3。");
