 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm... miss you don't have enough Arcs.","んー……お嬢さん、アークが足りないよ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Great! enter the mushroom field to start playing.","よし！ キノコ畑に入ってゲームを始めよう。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And if you manage to get a mushroom out of the ground perfectly you will get 50 arcs! in addition you can take it with you, people say that it is a perfect aphrodisiac.","キノコを完璧に引き抜けたら、50アークもらえるよ！ しかも、そのキノコは持ち帰っていい。最高の媚薬だって噂だよ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Red mushrooms give 10 Arcs, the blue ones give 20 and the green ones will give you 30 arcs.","赤いキノコは10アーク、青は20アーク、緑は30アークだよ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Depending on the skill with which you remove the mushrooms, you will be rewarded with money.","キノコを抜く腕前に応じて、お金がもらえるよ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Upon entering the mushroom field you will be given 30 seconds to take as many mushrooms as possible.","キノコ畑に入ると、できるだけ多く採れるように30秒間与えられるよ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What are the rules?","ルールは？");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, not at this time.","いや、今はやめておく。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I want to play!","遊びたい！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey want to play mushroom picking? You can play for 100 Arcs.","ねえ、キノコ狩りをしてみない？ 参加費は100アークだよ。");
