 ds_map_add(m,"Oh.. well I do not really know if I be-beat her at all.","ああ……その、彼女を倒せたのかどうか、よく分からないんだ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are the traveler who defeated the demond at the entrance of the city, right? some guards were talking about a traveler with blue hair and a single horn that's why I recognized you <3.","あなた、街の入口で悪魔を倒した旅人でしょう？ 青い髪に一本角の旅人の話を衛兵たちがしていたから、すぐ分かったわ<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, you the one with blue hair!","おい、そこの青髪！");
 ds_map_add(m,"It does not appear to be in operation there is a mess inside.","営業していないみたい。中も散らかっている。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What am I doing, hehe, the club is closed during the day.","私？ へへ、クラブは昼間は閉まっているのよ。");
