 ds_map_add(m,"Do not tell me by my name now I am the great captain, but is it true, will they have fallen asleep at the changing of the guard?","名前で呼ぶな。今の私は偉大なる隊長だ。だが、本当なのか？ 衛兵の交代時に、あいつらが寝てしまったというのは？");
 ds_map_add(m,"See Tamara! There is not a single damn guard in this sector other than the one in the night club.","見ろ、Tamara！ この区域には、ナイトクラブにいる奴以外、衛兵が一人もいないぞ。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I will be waiting for you next to the abandoned house, do not be late Line if not, I will continue without you.","廃屋の隣で待っているわ。Line、遅れないで。来なければ一人で先に進むから。");
 ds_map_add(m,"..... go do the mission Alura.","……任務に行け、Alura。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah easy, don't worry Tamara.","うん、簡単だよ。心配しないで、Tamara。");
