 ds_map_add(m,"I trust that they leave their position again because the house has no value.","あの家には価値がないから、また持ち場を離れるだろう。");
 ds_map_add(m,"They are in the forest south of here I ordered them to take care of an abandoned house.","彼女たちはここの南の森にいる。廃屋を見張るよう命じておいた。");
